<div style="background:#FEF3C7;border:2px solid #C9A84C;border-radius:10px;padding:16px;margin:20px;text-align:center"><span style="font-size:18px;font-weight:900;color:#1A3C6D">📝 答案鍵 (Answer Key)</span><br><span style="font-size:13px;color:#6B7280">紅字標示為正確答案</span></div><div class="lf-page">
<div class="lf-cover">
<div class="lf-cover-logo">霖楓學苑 · LF Academy</div>
<div class="lf-cover-grade">小三 · 第 13 堂 · 學生版講義</div>
<div class="lf-cover-title">長度單位</div>
<div class="lf-cover-subtitle">單元五 · mm · cm · m · km · 65 分鐘</div>
<div class="lf-cover-info">
<b>核心陷阱：</b>🪤 單位轉換！1m = 100cm（不是 10cm！）· 不同單位不能直加<br/>
<b>前置知識：</b>小二 cm 和 m 的認識<br/>
<b>本堂目標：</b>❶ 認識 mm、cm、m、km ❷ 單位轉換 ❸ 長度比較 ❹ 長度加減<br/>
<b>對應教材：</b>《小學數學新思維》3上A冊 單元七
</div>
<div class="lf-cover-row">
<span>學生姓名：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>班級：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>日期：<span class="lf-line"></span></span><span>完成時長：<span class="lf-line"></span></span>
</div></div>
<div>
<div <div="" style="text-align:center;margin:12px 0;"><svg style="max-width:280px;width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:8px auto;" viewbox="0 0 280 145" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="75" rx="2" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2.5" width="200" x="20" y="20"></rect>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-dasharray="4,2" stroke-width="1" x1="20" x2="220" y1="35" y2="35"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="20" x2="20" y1="30" y2="40"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="220" x2="220" y1="30" y2="40"></line>
<text fill="#6B7280" font-family="Noto Sans HK,sans-serif" font-size="10" text-anchor="middle" x="120.0" y="49">8 cm</text>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-dasharray="4,2" stroke-width="1" x1="238" x2="238" y1="20" y2="95"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="233" x2="243" y1="20" y2="20"></line>
<line stroke="#6B7280" stroke-width="1" x1="233" x2="243" y1="95" y2="95"></line>
</svg></div>
class="lf-h1"&gt;一、熱身啟動題 （5 分鐘）（共 5 題）<span class="star">⭐</span></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 1</td><td>1 米 = ＿＿ cm？（小二基礎）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 2</td><td>一支鉛筆大約多長？A. 15mm B. 15cm C. 15m</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 3</td><td>3m = ＿＿ cm？（1m = 100cm）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 4</td><td>你的食指指甲大約多闊？A. 1mm B. 1cm C. 1m</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 5</td><td>香港去廣州約 130 ＿＿（km/m/cm/mm？）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、核心知識精講 （15 分鐘）</div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：四個長度單位<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐ 最重要</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<table class="unit-table">
<tr><th>單位</th><th>中文</th><th>大約</th><th>用嚟量咩？</th></tr>
<tr><td><strong>mm</strong></td><td>毫米</td><td>指甲厚度</td><td>好短好幼嘅嘢（螺絲、膠擦厚度）</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>cm</strong></td><td>厘米</td><td>手指咁闊</td><td>書本、鉛筆、間尺</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>m</strong></td><td>米/公尺</td><td>一大步</td><td>課室、操場、身高</td></tr>
<tr><td><strong>km</strong></td><td>公里/千米</td><td>行 15 分鐘</td><td>城市之間距離、馬路長度</td></tr>
</table>
</div></div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：單位轉換（黃金公式！）<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 必考·最易錯！</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>四個必記轉換率：</strong><br/>
  ① <strong>1 cm = 10 mm</strong>（厘米轉毫米：x10）<br/>
  ② <strong>1 m = 100 cm</strong>（米轉厘米：x100）<br/>
  ③ <strong>1 km = 1000 m</strong>（公里轉米：x1000）<br/>
  ④ 大轉細 = <span style="color:var(--green);">乘法（x）</span>；細轉大 = <span style="color:var(--red);">除法（÷）</span>
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 1</div><div class="lf-ex-q">3m 5cm = ？cm</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">3m = 3 x 100 = 300 cm<br/>300 + 5 = <strong>305 cm</strong></div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">🪤 例題 2：陷阱！</div><div class="lf-ex-q">2m 30cm = ？cm</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ 常見錯誤</div><div class="eq">2m 30cm = 230 cm</div><div class="why">以為 1m = 100cm，所以 2x100=200+30=230。呢個係啱嘅！但有人寫成 2030...</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 更常見錯誤</div><div class="eq">2m 30cm = 2030 cm</div><div class="why">有人見到 2 同 30 就直接連埋寫！2m = 200cm，加 30cm = 230cm！</div></div>
</div></div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 致命陷阱 #1：1m = <strong>100</strong>cm，唔係 10cm！呢個係 P3 最常見嘅單位轉換錯誤！</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 致命陷阱 #2：唔同單位唔可以直接加數！例：3m + 50cm ≠ 53（必須先轉成相同單位！）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 6</td><td>5m = ＿＿ cm</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 7</td><td>300 cm = ＿＿ m</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 8</td><td>4m 25cm = ＿＿ cm</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 9</td><td>268 cm = ＿＿ m ＿＿ cm</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 10</td><td>1km = ＿＿ m；3km = ＿＿ m</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 11</td><td>5cm 8mm = ＿＿ mm</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-kp"><div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：長度比較與加減<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-mid">⭐</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
  ① 先轉成<strong>相同單位</strong><br/>
  ② 再比較大小 / 進行加減<br/>
  ③ 答案用<strong>最合適的單位</strong>表示
</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 3</div><div class="lf-ex-q">比較：2m 30cm 和 215cm，哪個較長？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">2m 30cm = 200 + 30 = 230 cm<br/>230 cm &gt; 215 cm<br/>所以：<strong>2m 30cm 較長</strong></div></div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題 4</div><div class="lf-ex-q">一條繩長 2m 45cm，另一條長 1m 80cm。兩條共長多少？</div>
<div style="font-size:14px;">方法1：轉 cm → 245 + 180 = 425 cm = <strong>4m 25cm</strong><br/>方法2：分開加 → (2+1)m + (45+80)cm = 3m 125cm = <strong>4m 25cm</strong></div></div>
<div class="lf-h2">同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 12</td><td>填 &gt; &lt; =：3m 50cm ＿＿ 340cm</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 13</td><td>1m 65cm + 2m 48cm = ？（用兩種方法）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 14</td><td>5m - 2m 30cm = ？（小心退位！）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">三、課堂分層同步練習 （20 分鐘）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">🌱 基礎層（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 15</td><td>2m = ＿＿ cm；500cm = ＿＿ m</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 16</td><td>6cm = ＿＿ mm；40mm = ＿＿ cm</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 17</td><td>3km = ＿＿ m；2000m = ＿＿ km</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌿 進階層（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 18</td><td>3m 75cm = ＿＿ cm</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 19</td><td>由長至短排列：2km, 2500m, 1km 800m</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 20</td><td>一條路長 1km 500m，已修了 850m。還有多長未修？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">🌳 挑戰層（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 21</td><td>小明身高 1m 38cm，爸爸比他高 37cm。爸爸身高多少？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 22</td><td>把 4m 5cm + 3m 95cm 的結果用 m 和 cm 表示。小心：cm 部分 ≥100 要進位！</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 23</td><td>一條繩剪成兩段，第一段長 2m 35cm，比第二段短 48cm。原來繩長多少？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">四、生活應用題（共 5 題）<span class="star">📏</span></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 24</td><td>📏 你的間尺有多長？大約 15 ＿＿（填單位）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 25</td><td>🚗 爸爸揸車由屋企去機場，距離是 35 ＿＿。（km/m/cm？）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 26</td><td>📐 課室長 8m 50cm，闊 6m 30cm。長比闊多幾多？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 27</td><td>🏃 小明跑一圈操場是 400m。跑了 5 圈，共跑了多少 m？即係幾多 km？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> 28</td><td>📏 一條絲帶長 5m。剪了 3 段，每段 80cm。還剩多長？（先乘後減）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">五、課後功課 （課後完成）<span class="star">📝</span></div>
<div class="lf-h2">基礎必做題（共 5 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> H1</td><td>填單位：鉛筆長約 18 ＿＿；門高約 2 ＿＿</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> H2</td><td>6m = ＿＿ cm；3km = ＿＿ m</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> H3</td><td>2m 45cm = ＿＿ cm</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> H4</td><td>1m 50cm + 2m 75cm = ？（小心 cm ≥100 要進位！）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> H5</td><td>一條繩長 3m，用去 1m 60cm。還剩多長？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">進階選做題（共 3 題）</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>題目</th><th class="lf-qd">難度</th><th>作答區</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> H6</td><td>3km 500m + 2km 800m = ？（小心 m ≥1000 要進位！）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> H7</td><td>一條路長 5km。第一天修了 1km 600m，第二天修了 2km 400m。還剩多長未修？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700">✓</span> H8</td><td>圍欄長度的 <span class="f"><span class="n">1</span><span class="b"></span><span class="d">4</span></span> 是 75cm。整條圍欄長多少 cm？即幾多米？</td><td class="qd d4">🏔️</td><td class="lf-ans"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">六、本堂核心易錯點總結 （8 分鐘）</div>
<div style="margin:14px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#F0FDF4;border:1.5px solid #BBF7D0;border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#166534;">✅ 本堂自我檢查（完成後打剔）</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我識得分辦每個知識點嘅陷阱</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠獨立完成🌱基礎題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我能夠挑戰🌿進階題</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 我記得住口訣</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin:12px 0;padding:10px 14px;background:#FFFBEB;border:1.5px solid var(--gold);border-radius:6px;font-size:12px;">
<strong style="color:#92400E;">🎯 學習目標回顧 — 完成本堂後你應該能夠：</strong>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;margin-top:6px;">
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 辨認本堂所有陷阱類型</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 獨立解答🌱基礎題（100%正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 挑戰🌿進階題（80%+正確）</span>
<span style="background:white;padding:3px 8px;border-radius:4px;border:1px solid #D1D5DB;">☐ 向同學解釋本堂口訣</span>
</div>
</div>
<table class="et">
<tr><th>#</th><th>易錯點</th><th>正確做法</th></tr>
<tr><td>1</td><td><strong>1m = 10cm</strong>（大錯！）</td><td>1m = <strong>100</strong>cm</td></tr>
<tr><td>2</td><td><strong>1km = 100m</strong>（大錯！）</td><td>1km = <strong>1000</strong>m</td></tr>
<tr><td>3</td><td><strong>唔同單位直加</strong>：3m+50cm=53</td><td>先轉同單位：300+50=350cm 或 3.5m</td></tr>
<tr><td>4</td><td><strong>m→cm 乘錯</strong>：以為 x10</td><td>m→cm = x<strong>100</strong>；cm→mm = x10</td></tr>
<tr><td>5</td><td><strong>cm 加完 ≥100 唔識進位</strong></td><td>每 100cm = 1m，要進位！</td></tr>
<tr><td>6</td><td><strong>比較大小時未轉同單位</strong></td><td>一定要先轉成相同單位先比較</td></tr>
<tr><td>7</td><td><strong>單位符號寫錯</strong></td><td>m=米, cm=厘米, mm=毫米, km=公里</td></tr>
</table>
<div class="mn">🧠 口訣一：「米變厘米乘一百，厘米變毫米乘十；公里變米乘一千，大轉細乘細轉除。」</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 口訣二：「唔同單位要轉換，相同單位先比較；cm加滿一百進一米，小心進位唔好漏。」</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">①</div><div class="t">睇單位</div><div class="d">mm/cm/m/km?</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">②</div><div class="t">轉換</div><div class="d">全部轉同單位</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">③</div><div class="t">計算</div><div class="d">加減或比較</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">④</div><div class="t">寫單位</div><div class="d">答案要有合適單位</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-tip" style="text-align:center;font-size:14px;">🌟 長度單位係日常生活中最常用嘅數學！記住 1m = 100cm，唔好記錯！好叻呀！💪</div>
